      "content": "idk i just dont really want to spend 100 bucks on an urgent care visit if i dont have to lol. i feel like i know my body and this feels way more like a bacterial thing than a cold. if i just take like 500mg of the amoxicillin now, wouldn't that just kill it before it really starts? i'd rather just handle it myself so i dont have to deal with the doctor side of things.",
